from Swimming Pool. The property has Fire Sprinklers. Some other provisions include access to Multipurpose Room.\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Jul 2020\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹12,720/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n1305 - 1555 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Access to important landmarks.\n* Schools, hospitals, educational institutes, restaurants, banks, and a movie theatre are all nearby.\n* Kandivali is easily accessible via the Western Express Highway, S V Road, and Link Road.\n\n* The club house, children's play area, cycling and jogging tracks are among the amenities.\n* Kandivali railway station is 2.4 kilometres away.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nProject Status: The development faced significant historical stalls and delays, leading the high court to grant flat buyers permission to self-develop the remaining structure. Location and Layout: The property is situated in the Dahanukar Wadi area of Kandivali West and comprises spacious layouts primarily configured as two bedroom units.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nConnectivity Benefits\n\nThe property offers convenient access to major arterial routes, public transport buses, auto-rickshaws, and the local metro line.\n\nProximity to Amenities\n\nThe complex is situated close to necessary social infrastructure including prominent educational institutes, healthcare facilities, markets, and supermarkets.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nMajor Construction Delays\n\nThe project experienced severe setbacks and prolonged stalled construction work after structural development halted mid-way.\n\nTraffic Bottlenecks\n\nThe surrounding external roads connecting to main highways experience high vehicular density and heavy congestion during rush hours.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nAvoid due to execution risk\n\nGood layout sizes\n\nWell connected location\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/swimming-pool-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-secondary.svg)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![amenities/walking-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-secondary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-primary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-primary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-primary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-primary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-primary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/swimming-pool-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-primary.svg)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![amenities/walking-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-primary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-primary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n2 BHK\n\n* ## 1305 sq. ft\n* ## 1555 sq. ft\n\nName\n\n2 BHK\n\nPrice Range\n\n₹1.66 Cr\n\n![Floor_Plan_Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/properties/rna-corp-rna-palazzo-2-bhk-bedroom-1677066354.webp)\n\n## Locality\n\n![bank-primary](/assets/icons/bank-primary.svg)\n\nbank\n\n![hospital-secondary](/assets/icons/hospital-secondary.svg)\n\nhospital\n\n![school-secondary](/assets/icons/school-secondary.svg)\n\nschool\n\n![pdp-bank](/assets/icons/pdp-bank.svg)\n\nSbi Branch Hindustan Naka Kandivli West\n\n0.1 km\n\n![pdp-bank](/assets/icons/pdp-bank.svg)\n\nSbi Branch Sme Kandivali\n\n0.5 km\n\n![pdp-bank](/assets/icons/pdp-bank.svg)\n\nBank Of Baroda Atm\n\n0.8 km\n\n![pdp-bank](/assets/icons/pdp-bank.svg)\n\nHdfc Bank\n\n0.8 km\n\n![pdp-bank](/assets/icons/pdp-bank.svg)\n\nKotak Mahindra Bank\n\n0.8 km\n\n![pdp-bank](/assets/icons/pdp-bank.svg)\n\nKotak Mahindra Bank Atm\n\n0.8 km\n\n### Home Loan Calculator\n\nStarting from₹1,73,466per month\n\nExplore the cost of your home by adjusting the details\n\nTotal amount : ₹2,08,15,928\n\n## Enquire Now\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\nLet us reach out to you at the earliest.\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![smartphone-primary](/assets/icons/smartphone-primary.svg)+91![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nREQUEST A CALLBACK\n\nI am happy to be contacted by Blox\n\n## RERA QR Codes\n\nRNA Palazzois a real estate project registered under MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority), ensuring transparency and accountability in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()[P51800002906](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800002906)\n\nRNA Palazzo\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for RNA Palazzo?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nPossession date of RNA Palazzo is 31 Jul 2020\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of RNA Palazzo?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for RNA Palazzo is 1305 - 1555 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of RNA Palazzo?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of RNA Palazzo is ₹1.66 Cr - 1.71 Cr\n\n### Where is RNA Palazzo located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nRNA Palazzo is located at RNA Palazzo, Ahead of Dahanukar Wadi, Off M.G.Road, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067.\n\n### What configurations are available in RNA Palazzo?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nRNA Palazzo has 2 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of RNA Palazzo?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of RNA Palazzo is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in RNA Palazzo?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Senior citizen Area, Swimming Pool, Walking Area, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of RNA Palazzo?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of RNA Palazzo is RNA Corp.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for RNA Palazzo:RNA Corp](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/170223113747-newproject-38.webp)\n\n## RNA Corp\n\nRNA Corp, formerly recognized as RNA Builders (A.A.), stands as a distinguished and accomplished property developer in India, with a rich legacy spanning over three decades. Throughout its journey, the company has delivered superior real estate solutions to both individual and corporate clients, establishing a reputation for excellence. At the heart of RNA Corp's mission is the dedication to fulfilling the diverse needs of its customers. This commitment is reflected in their consistent delivery of projects characterized by exceptional quality, adherence to budgetary constraints, and timely completion. With a proud history of successfully completed residential projects across the Mumbai Metropolitan Region, RNA Developers takes immense pride in its extensive portfolio. This portfolio not only showcases the company's expertise and attention to detail but also underlines its ability to meet the high standards of its clientele. Moreover, RNA Corp remains forward-focused, with several new projects in the pipeline. This forward-thinking approach demonstrates the company's dedication to continuous growth and innovation within the dynamic real estate sector, ensuring a promising future in the industry.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/je-vee-infrastructure-shree-gopaldham-elevation-1762949548.jpg)\n\n![Shree Gopaldham](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/240522105543-jeeandvee.png)\n\nShree Gopaldham\n\nKandivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹3.45 Cr - 5.64 Cr\n\n3, 4 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rudra-amar-group-shivani-rudram-elevation-1755173792.jpg)\n\n![Shivani Rudram](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/260525085623-newproject-2025-05-26t205415973.webp)\n\nShivani Rudram\n\nKandivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.08 Cr - 2.34 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/ambit-builders-and-developers-ambit-primoris-elevation-1743572617.webp)\n\n![Ambit Primoris](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/300923111153-newproject-2023-09-30t111141705.webp)\n\nAmbit Primoris\n\nKandivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.98 Cr - 3.96 Cr\n