oom](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-6830.jpeg)\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-6838.jpeg)\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-6839.jpeg)\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-6840.jpeg)\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-6841.jpeg)\n\n![Typical Floor Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-364.jpeg)\n\n![Layout Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-6834.jpeg)\n\n![Location Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-363.jpeg)\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-6838.jpeg)\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-6839.jpeg)\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-6840.jpeg)\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-6841.jpeg)\n\n![Typical Floor Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-364.jpeg)\n\n![Location Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/photo-363.jpeg)\n\nby RNA Corp\n\n# RNA Palazzo\n\nM.G Road, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\nConfig: 2 BHK Apartments\n\nSize 1305 Sq.ft. To 1380 Sq.ft.\n\nPrice ₹ 1.63 Cr Onwards\n\nCall Now +919820575619\n\n**Code:** PropertyCrow21\n\nPossession Status Ready To Move Since February 2015\n\nRERA P51800002906  \n[View RERA QR Code](#qr)\n\nUnits Available Investor / Resale Units Available\n\nAbout Project\n\n## RNA PALAZZO\n\n**RNA Palazzo by RNA Corp** is a grand 33-floored project with 2 BHK flats having an area of 1250 sq. ft. and 1380 sq. ft. Malad Link Road is in the immediate proximity. The buyers will find the market very near for the purchase of the valuable commodities. The residents of this place don’t have to go far away for shopping for th\n\ne simple reason that there are two allusive malls such infinity mall,l in-orbit mall and multiplex for movie-goers. Moreover CBSE and ICSE/IGCSE level schools are also found in the immediate proximity. This project is located in an environmentally salubrious place. The drive to this site is just a joy without any pensiveness of traffic jam.  \n  \nNevertheless amenities like community hall, gymnasium, kids pool, yoga and meditation centre, playhouses, fitness centre, jogger’s path and hi speed elevators, air-conditioned rooms, indoor games rooms, intercom, phone, security, health spa with steam, Jacuzzi and sauna, club house, swimming pool, power backup, hi-speed elevators, security vigilance, park, reserved parking, service lift, lounge, water supply, wi-fi connectivity, piped gas connection, video door phone, teakwood door frames, gas leakage detector, modular switches, fittings, and fixtures, hospitals, schools, colleges, malls, theatres, art and design studios, transportation facilities are found in this part Kandivali West. The buyers can contact on the above given number.\n\nType, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | 1305 | 1.63 CR |\n| 2 BHK | 1380 | 1.72 CR |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n\\* Clubhouse  \n\\* Swimming pool  \n\\* Barbeque Zone  \n\\* Library & Hobby Pool  \n\\* Health Club & Spa  \n\\* Jaccuzzi & Steam Bath  \n\\* Gymnasium  \n\\* Landscape garden  \n\\* High Speed Elevators & 1 service Elevator  \n\\* Video door phone  \n\\* Entrance lobby\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n\\* Wooden flooring in master bedroom and crystal white flooring in living, dining, kitchen, passages and children's bedroom.  \n  \n\\* Beautiful French Windows of heavy duty section with viewing windows in anodized frames and imported marble sills.  \n  \n\\* Designer Door with 65mm thickness panelled main door shutter and both side white watercut duco paint finish along with a viewing window.  \n  \n\\* Plastic emulsion paint inside and acrylic paint externally.  \n  \n\\* Easy and convenient piped gas connection of your kitchen and gas leakage detector for safety.  \n  \n\\* Designer sanitary ware and fixtures, concealed plumbing, shower cabinet and imported shower panel in master bedroom.  \n  \n\\* Keep out the Hot Wave with provision of fitting A/C in all the rooms.  \n  \n\\* The entrance lobby monitored via module door phone with access of viewing from each home. This is the latest in security solutions.\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nRERA Details\n\n## RERA QR Code\n\n![](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/21/qra_2237.png)\n\n**RERA No:** P51800002906\n\n**Developer:** RNA Corp\n\n**Project:** RNA Palazzo\n\n[Verify on MahaRERA Website →](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - M.G Road, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** M.G Road, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** Near M.G Road, Close proximity to the Malad Link Road, Dhanukar Wadi, Jain Temple, Kala Hanuman Mandir, Sanghvi Industrial Estate\n\nFAQ\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about RNA PALAZZO\n\nWhere is RNA Palazzo Exactly located?\n\nRNA Palazzo is located at M.G Road, Kandivali West, .\n\nIs RNA Palazzo Rera Registered?\n\nYes, It is RERA Registered with Rera Number P51800002906. You can verify the details on the official RERA website.\n\nWhat are unit options available in RNA Palazzo?\n\nRNA Palazzo offers 2 BHK Apartments.\n\nWhat is the starting price of Flats in RNA Palazzo?\n\nThe starting price of Flats at RNA Palazzo is 1.63 Cr Onwards. Contact us for the latest pricing and offers.\n\nWhen is the Possession of Flats?\n\nThe expected possession date for RNA Palazzo is Ready To Move Since February 2015.\n\nWhat are the nearest landmarks?\n\nKey landmarks near RNA Palazzo include Charkop Bus Depot, Sarovar Restaurant, Martins The Chinese Nook, Mangal